<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Shekem Q3 loss 17 mln shekels.</title>
<headline>Israel's Shekem Q3 loss 17 mln shekels.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Shekem Ltd reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>				(in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			     Q3 96	Q3 95   9-MTH 96    9-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		  291,032    297,939    854,546     850,443</p>
<p>Operating profit  Loss14,859 Loss12,622 Loss48,429  Loss35,724</p>
<p>Net Profit	  Loss16,638  Loss8,896  Loss9,587  Loss31,407</p>
<p>($1 = 3.25 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
